# Plays hole 1 of the test course from the tee to the cup, for a debug PRC
# built with EXTRA=-DPLAY_SEED=3 (a fixed wind, 13 mph). Start it on the
# tee view once it's drawn. Two swings at 95 % power with the snap on time
# (start on the strip, power at 950 ms, snap 712 ms later), then two putts
# with the power click past the meter's cup mark, as the IIIx plays them:
# a par. Times are multiples of 10 ms so the meter reads the same at any
# tick phase, and the power click stays clear of the meter's end, where a
# late tap turns into the snap. On the green it opens the map for the debug
# timings and comes back, before each putt.
# The drive.
# Clicks after each swing start are 120 ms later than the meter times above: on the IIIx the
# meter's clock starts about then, once its first frames show.
0 pen-down 20 150
60 pen-up
820 snapshot "{out}/s1-meter.png"
1070 pen-down 80 60
1130 pen-up
1780 pen-down 80 60
1840 pen-up
3620 snapshot "{out}/s1-flight.png"
6620 snapshot "{out}/s1-roll.png"
9120 snapshot "{out}/s1-result.png"
19120 snapshot "{out}/s2-aim.png"
# The approach.
20120 pen-down 20 150
20180 pen-up
21190 pen-down 80 60
21250 pen-up
21900 pen-down 80 60
21960 pen-up
23740 snapshot "{out}/s2-flight.png"
26740 snapshot "{out}/s2-roll.png"
29040 snapshot "{out}/s2-result.png"
38240 snapshot "{out}/p1-aim.png"
# The map, with the green view's draw time (S, ms) on its strip, and back.
38440 pen-down 119 153
38500 pen-up
39240 snapshot "{out}/p1-map.png"
39440 pen-down 80 60
39500 pen-up
# The first putt.
40240 pen-down 20 150
40300 pen-up
40760 snapshot "{out}/p1-meter.png"
41090 pen-down 80 60
41150 pen-up
42160 snapshot "{out}/p1-roll.png"
44760 snapshot "{out}/p1-result.png"
# The map again for the putting meter and roll frame times, and back.
47360 pen-down 119 153
47420 pen-up
48360 snapshot "{out}/p2-map.png"
48560 pen-down 80 60
48620 pen-up
51360 snapshot "{out}/p2-aim.png"
# The second, and in.
52360 pen-down 20 150
52420 pen-up
52870 pen-down 80 60
52930 pen-up
